# Known bug: an object's own characteristic-defining abilities of layer 7a and later still apply once it has lost all its abilities (CR 604.3, 613.1f, 613.4a); `statics` in layers.rs applies `def.statics` that are `own` whatever LoseAllAbilities says.
# Tarmogoyf: "power is equal to the number of card types among cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1",
# a characteristic-defining ability, which is a static ability (CR 604.3). With Lightning Bolt in a graveyard it is 1/2 (the control).
# Bot2's The Wondrous Wasp takes every ability from it on turn 2, the ability with them, and what is left is the printed */1+* with the
# star worth 0 (CR 208.2a, 208.5): a 0/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Tarmogoyf
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
The Wondrous Wasp
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tarmogoyf.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Toughness = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.The Wondrous Wasp.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Target(Tarmogoyf)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Power = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Toughness = 1
